<title>USA: FCC grants WinStar four licences.</title>
<headline>FCC grants WinStar four licences.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>WinStar Communications Inc said Monday the Federal Communications Commission (FCC) granted it four new 38-gigahertz licenses.</p>
<p>WinStar had filed for the licenses before the FCC stopped accepting new applications in late 1995, a statement said. The licenses cover Las Vegas, Denver, Honolulu and Mobile, Ala.</p>
<p>WinStar opened at 13 Monday, up 3/8.</p>
</text>
